<title>USA: Sun International Q1 net shr $0.58 vs $0.52.</title>
<headline>Sun International Q1 net shr $0.58 vs $0.52.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.58		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			 19,685		   12,817</p>
<p> Revs		     147,413		   66,768</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,945		   24,851</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The first quarter net income figures reflect an extraordinary loss on retirement of debt of $0.09 a share. Net per share before an extraordinary item was $0.67 or $22.6 million, vs $0.52 or $12.8 million.</p>
